Z||000000||Darren's 87 coupe||10-19-2001||09:05 AM||||ok I know that Honda is a bad word in here, but I got to drive My father in laws Del sol the other day with the top off and the back glass rolled down and man it felt good.  I know I have seen the Fiero with the removable back glass, but i was wondering if anyone has ever made a fiero with a slide down electic glass window in the back like the del sol?  The window feature was the only thing really cool about the del sol i must admit.  The contols and the dash and the exterior are no way near as great as my Fiero.<BR>Darren||||reg||1
